  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台灣ê原先住民"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<h1><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">Tâi-oân ê Goân-sian Chū-bîn</span></h1><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b><span><b>陳雷</b></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b><br /></b></span></p><p><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">（本文是漢羅合用kap全羅馬字一段一段對照）</span></b></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你kám bat好奇想chit个問題：台灣上早ê住民是啥人？In ùi佗位來--ê？Chit-má tī佗位？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lí kám bat hò͘ⁿ-kî siūⁿ chit ê būn-tê: Tâi-oân siōng chá ê chū-bîn sī siáⁿ-lâng? In ùi tó-ūi lâi--ê? Chit-má tī tó-ūi?</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">現代人差不多20萬冬前tī非洲出現。大約七、八萬冬前離開非洲大陸，ǹg東tòe海岸沿路遷徙，五、六萬冬前來到東南亞洲。In有烏皮膚、khiû頭毛，體格khah矮。主要拍獵、掠魚。In ê工具屬tī古石器時代。Hit時冰河時期，海水面比chit-má khah低130公尺。亞洲東南部是一塊陸地，叫做<i>Sundaland</i>。西爿是<i>Malay</i>半島，北爿是中南半島接亞洲大陸，包含泰國灣（<i>Gulf of Thailand</i>），東爿包含一部份ê南中國海，南爿到印尼群島。In ùi chia漸漸遷徙，ǹg南到印尼、紐西蘭、澳洲，ǹg北到亞洲大陸東南部份，ǹg東到菲律賓、到台灣。Chia-ê古石器時代ê人就是台灣上古早ê原始住民。不過chit-má除了tī澳洲、紐西蘭、印度ê <i>Andaman</i>以外，in已經hō͘後--來ê新石器時代ê人消滅或者同化。所以tī台灣也揣無in ê跤跡。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hiān-tāi-lâng chha-put-to 20 bān tang chêng tī Hui-chiu chhut-hiān. Tāi-iok 7, 8 bān tang chêng lī-khui Hui-chiu tāi-lio̍k, ǹg tang tòe hái-hōaⁿ iân-lō͘ chhian-sóa, 5, 6 bān tang chêng lâi kàu Tang-lâm A-chiu. In ū o͘ phôe-hu, khiû thâu-mo͘, thé-keh khah é. Chú-iàu phah-la̍h, lia̍h hî. In ê kang-khū sio̍k-tī kó͘ chio̍h-khì sî-tāi. Hit-sî peng-hô sî-kî, hái-chúi-bīn pí chit-má khah kē 130 kong-chhioh. A-chiu tang-lâm-pō͘ sī 1 tè lio̍k-tē, kiò-chò <i>Sundaland</i>. Sai-pêng sī <i>Malay</i> pòaⁿ-tó, pak-pêng sī Tiong-lâm pòaⁿ-tó chiap A-chiu tāi-lio̍k, pau-hâm Thài-kok-oan (<i>Gulf of Thailand</i>), tang-pêng pau-hâm chi̍t-pō͘-hūn ê Lâm Tiong-kok-hái, lâm-pêng kàu Ìn-nî kûn-tó. In ùi chia chiām-chiām chhian-sóa, ǹg lâm kàu Ìn-nî, Niú-se-lân, Ò-chiu, ǹg pak kàu A-chiu tāi-lio̍k tang-lâm pō͘-hūn, ǹg tang kàu Hui-li̍t-pin, kàu Tâi-oân. Chia-ê kó͘ chio̍h-khì sî-tāi ê lâng tō sī Tâi-oân siōng kó͘-chá ê goân-sí chū-bîn. Put-kò chit-má tû-liáu tī Ò-chiu, Niú-se-lân, Ìn-tō͘ ê <i>Andaman</i> í-gōa, in í-keng hō͘ āu--lâi ê sin chio̍h-khì sî-tāi ê lâng siau-bia̍t he̍k-chiá tông-hòa. Só͘-í tī Tâi-oân iā chhōe bô in ê kha-jiah.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">到新石器時代，亞洲大陸東南部ê住民有造船、種稻仔ê農業技術、造粗瓷，mā有刺青、khà喙齒ê風俗，叫做先南島系人（<i>pro-Austronesian</i>），kap長江以北ê新石器人完全無仝血緣。Chit款新石器時代ê先南島系人大約七、八千冬前來到台灣。因為海峽地理，漸漸分離演化，一直到chit-má。In就是台灣原住民（Amay、Tayal、Bunun、Tsou……）kap目前70、80 pha 台灣人ê祖先。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kàu sin chio̍h-khì sî-tāi, A-chiu tāi-lio̍k tang-lâm-pō͘ ê chū-bîn ū chō-chûn, chèng tiū-á ê lông-gia̍p ki-su̍t, chō chho͘-hûi, mā ū chhiah-chhiⁿ, khà chhùi-khí ê hong-sio̍k, kiò-chò sian Lâm-tó-hē lâng (<i>pro-Austronesian</i>), kap Tn̂g-kang í-pak ê sin chio̍h-khì lâng oân-choân bô-kāng hiat-iân. Chit khoán sin chio̍h-khì sî-tāi ê sian Lâm-tó-hē lâng tāi-iok 7, 8 chheng tang chêng lâi kàu Tâi-oân. In-ūi hái-kiap tē-lí, chiām-chiām hun-lî ián-hòa, it-ti̍t kàu chit-má. In tō sī Tâi-oân Goân-chū-bîn (Amay, Tayal, Bunun, Tsou....) kap bo̍k-chêng 70, 80 pha Tâi-oân-lâng ê chó͘-sian.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">五千到三千冬前，台灣ê南島系人開始tùi外移民。靠in優秀行海ê技術先到菲律賓。Tī以後三千年中間，繼續遷徙，傳播in行海、農業技術（包含稻仔、番薯、鹿仔樹……）kap語言風俗。Ǹg東包含規个南太平洋，一直到<i>Easter Island</i>，ǹg西到印度洋<i>Madagascar</i>，ǹg南到印尼、紐西蘭，ǹg北甚至到日本南部九州、四國。In就是全世界南島系人kap世界第二大語系南島語系（<i>Austronesian language family</i>，有1,257種語言）ê祖先。實在奇蹟，mā是台灣hō͘世界ê大禮。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">5,000 kàu 3,000 tang chêng, Tâi-oân ê Lâm-tó-hē lâng khai-sí tùi-gōa î-bîn. Khò in iu-siù kiâⁿ-hái ê ki-su̍t seng kàu Hui-li̍t-pin. Tī í-āu 3,000 nî tiong-kan, kè-sio̍k chhian-sóa, thoân-pò͘ in kiâⁿ-hái, lông-gia̍p ki-su̍t (pau-hâm tiū-á, han-chû, lo̍k-á-chhiū....) kap gú-giân hong-sio̍k. Ǹg tang pau-hâm kui-ê Lâm Thài-pêng-iûⁿ, it-ti̍t kàu <i>Easter Island</i>, ǹg sai kàu Ìn-tō͘-iûⁿ <i>Madagascar</i>, ǹg lâm kàu Ìn-nî, Niú-se-lân, ǹg pak sīm-chì kàu Ji̍t-pún lâm-pō͘ Kiú-chiu, Sì-kok. In tō sī choân sè-kài Lâm-tó-hē lâng kap sè-kài tē-2 tōa gú-hē Lâm-tó-gú-hē (<i>Austronesian language family</i>, ū 1,257 chióng gú-giân) ê chó͘-sian. Si̍t-chāi kî-chek, mā sī Tâi-oân hō͘ sè-kài ê tōa-lé.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhNIeWBVoOsG0oVy5G1sWEhXHcQ5sFszCIb86phKAXoBhk6jWJq_UcaHByYHkjNruAzg8gssBn1sMSCyOr9DS0CYDdvX0AwwLqg8Ekw03jWS8PXh2f7C9EZNbeYWnjT7TPzZ3sgHgk7JBxUg_yf1gVHig27Y29d627JkqQHb0VRHKQPONrdXfr4WjEFqA/s1421/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhNIeWBVoOsG0oVy5G1sWEhXHcQ5sFszCIb86phKAXoBhk6jWJq_UcaHByYHkjNruAzg8gssBn1sMSCyOr9DS0CYDdvX0AwwLqg8Ekw03jWS8PXh2f7C9EZNbeYWnjT7TPzZ3sgHgk7JBxUg_yf1gVHig27Y29d627JkqQHb0VRHKQPONrdXfr4WjEFqA/w450-h640/340%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator